Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.03,0:00:01.28,Short,,0,0,0,,Onions make you cry
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.28,0:00:02.22,Short,,0,0,0,,on purpose
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:04.42,Short,,0,0,0,,Inside every onion cell
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.42,0:00:05.08,Short,,0,0,0,,two chemicals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.08,0:00:06.26,Short,,0,0,0,,are kept apart
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.56,0:00:07.23,Short,,0,0,0,,When your knife
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.23,0:00:08.24,Short,,0,0,0,,breaks the cells
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.24,0:00:08.71,Short,,0,0,0,,they mix
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.71,0:00:09.62,Short,,0,0,0,,and an enzyme
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.62,0:00:11.26,Short,,0,0,0,,turns them into a gas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.59,0:00:12.70,Short,,0,0,0,,That gas floats up
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.70,0:00:13.44,Short,,0,0,0,,into your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.44,0:00:14.28,Short,,0,0,0,,and irritates
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.28,0:00:15.08,Short,,0,0,0,,the nerves there
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.08,0:00:15.84,Short,,0,0,0,,so your eyes
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.84,0:00:16.72,Short,,0,0,0,,flood with tears
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.72,0:00:18.18,Short,,0,0,0,,to wash it out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.18,0:00:19.04,Short,,0,0,0,,It's how the onion
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.04,0:00:19.84,Short,,0,0,0,,defends itself
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.84,0:00:21.24,Short,,0,0,0,,from hungry animals
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.63,0:00:22.96,Short,,0,0,0,,In 2002
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.96,0:00:23.82,Short,,0,0,0,,scientists found
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.82,0:00:24.96,Short,,0,0,0,,the exact enzyme
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.96,0:00:25.94,Short,,0,0,0,,that makes the gas
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.94,0:00:27.10,Short,,0,0,0,,and later grew onions
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.10,0:00:28.86,Short,,0,0,0,,that barely make it
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.86,0:00:30.58,Short,,0,0,0,,Cold slows the gas down
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.58,0:00:31.62,Short,,0,0,0,,and a sharp knife
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.62,0:00:32.96,Short,,0,0,0,,crushes fewer cells
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.23,0:00:33.86,Short,,0,0,0,,So next time
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.86,0:00:34.72,Short,,0,0,0,,you chop one
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.72,0:00:35.34,Short,,0,0,0,,chill it first
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.34,0:00:35.80,Short,,0,0,0,,because
Dialogue: 1,0:00:26.85,0:00:32.95,Prompt,,0,0,0,,{\fad(300,250)}Send this to someone\Nwho cries over onions
